<speak>I've been gardening, actually. The borders had become rather neglected while we were busy at the studio. It's pleasant to have something practical to do that doesn't involve a screen. Anyway, I have my details here. My identification number is <sub alias="tee">T</sub> nine nine four eight six seven seven <sub alias="ex">X</sub>. My date of birth is the seventh of May nineteen eighty-three.</speak>